## Scope

This MIT License covers only the code written for this port itself — the dsh
loading shell (`lib/`), packaging (`package.json`, `cordis.patch.yml`) and tests
(`test/`, `scripts/`). It does not cover the upstream content under `skills/`
and `.claude-plugin/`, which is copied verbatim from davila7/claude-code-templates
and remains under each directory's own license (Apache-2.0, MIT, or Anthropic
source-available) — see `skills/ANTHROPIC_ATTRIBUTION.md` and
`THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.
